    "AI 推測僅供參考，落單前請務必同餐廳確認。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AI guesses are advisory only; always confirm with the restaurant before ordering."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AI 推測僅供參考，落單前請務必同餐廳確認。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI 翻譯新菜單時會標示可能含有呢啲食材嘅菜式。判斷僅供參考，未必準確，落單前請務必同餐廳確認。設定只影響之後新辨識嘅菜單。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When AI translates a new menu, it flags dishes that may contain these ingredients. This is advisory only and may be inaccurate, so always confirm with the restaurant before ordering. This setting only affects newly recognized menus."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AI 翻譯新菜單時會標示可能含有呢啲食材嘅菜式。判斷僅供參考，未必準確，落單前請務必同餐廳確認。設定只影響之後新辨識嘅菜單。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
