    "已完成菜單嘅原始相片會喺選定期限後自動清理，帳單同菜式紀錄會完整保留；未完成嘅菜單唔會被清理。已清理嘅相片無法還原，加長期限都唔會令佢哋返返嚟。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Original photos of completed menus are cleared automatically after the selected period. The bill and dish records are kept in full, and unfinished menus are never pruned. Cleared photos cannot be recovered — extending the period will not bring them back."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
